&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As the team grows around you — a data scientist, a behavioural researcher, an ML engineer — the routes are principal-level ownership of product behavioural data across Diligent, or leading the team that runs it. We&#39;d rather be straight with you than promise a title we cannot yet name. The scope is real, and it is expanding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
